## Key Design Decisions

- **Job created as IDLE, not PAYMENT**: The `status` useMemo overrides `viewStatus` when `activeJob.status` is `'PAYMENT'`. Creating the job as `IDLE` prevents this override, allowing `SETTINGS_PREVIEW` to render.
- **Pricing defaults to ₹3/page B&W**: Matches `PRICE_PER_PAGE: 3` in backend [utils.js](file:///home/rev/Documents/projects/leprint/backend/modules/utils.js). Color is ₹10/page.
- **Pi-agent fallback**: Empty `settings = {}` produces an empty `opts` array, resulting in the original `lp -d printer "file"` command — zero regression.
- **Page range sanitized**: Only passed to CUPS if it matches `/^[\d,\-]+$/`.
